      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. LASSO (5) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Found it a bit far latest when finished fifth over 520m at Q Parklands (30.70) in a Grade 4/5 but is better suited back in trip here. Has a good record here at this journey including four wins. Form from his last run is proving strong. Better than last start and worth following up. MULLIGRUB (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (20.03) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Bold showing expected. TUKI BEACH (2) has found the frame here at the last couple of runs when prominent throughout, most recently when second beaten 1.5 lengths (19.88). Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Bold showing expected. CANYA ONSLAUGHT (3) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
